WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.000
Shibuya, 11:40 p.m.

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:08.000
The last trains are still running.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Every sign is a different red.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Three thousand people cross at once.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Then the light changes and it empties.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:29.000
This is where the city goes quiet.
